  "published": "2026-10-28T18:34:56Z",
  "modified": "2026-10-28T18:34:56Z",
  "details": "- CVE-2026-86047: quote identifiers and values in SHOW CREATE TABLE/USER, SHOW\n  GRANTS, mariadb-dump, mariadb-show and mariadb-convert-table-format,\n  including DATA/INDEX DIRECTORY paths; table option names outside\n  [A-Za-z0-9_] are rejected even under IGNORE_BAD_TABLE_OPTIONS, and existing\n  tables with such options no longer open (ERROR 1911)\n- CVE-2026-92262: refuse #mysql50# names that mix up with table names in the\n  table cache and on disk\n- CVE-2026-107823: escape view definer user/host in frm files; views whose\n  stored definer contains a backslash no longer open (ERROR 1343) or get an\n  altered definer; re-create them\n- CVE-2026-107821: validate frm data when opening a table; tables with a\n  CHAR(205..255) CHARACTER SET filename column converted by earlier builds no\n  longer open (ERROR 1033)\n- CVE-2026-85746: fix heap buffer overflow in ST_AsText() for nested geometry\n  collections\n- CVE-2026-107814: do not use the data directory as the mysql user's home; new\n  accounts and sysusers.d use /; on upgrade an existing account's home is\n  switched to / unless the server is running (a warning is printed then)",
